{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "5d95d69a-10bd-4f5f-96c9-f071d40c4584",
    "name": "Attendance Relay API - v1",
    "description": "Collection for cloud employee CRUD, machine employee CRUD, and machine photo APIs.\n\nVariables:\n- base_url: API server base URL\n- api_key: x-api-key for /api/v1/* endpoints\n- machine_ip, machine_port, machine_number: target device\n- employee_code, user_id: current employee under test\n- photo_data_base64_8192: base64 payload for SetUserPhotoData (must represent 8192 bytes)\n\nDefault test flow:\n1) Cloud Employees -> Create Employee (With Machine Sync)\n2) Machine Employees -> Read Employee (Machine)\n3) Machine Photo -> Set User Photo Data\n4) Machine Photo -> Get User Photo Data\n5) Machine Employees -> Disable / Enable / Delete\n6) Cloud Employees -> Delete Employee",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
